        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. An employee who is absent more than thirty (30) regular working days during an anniversary year, or whose Leave of Absence continues from one anniversary year to another, shall have a new anniversary date adjusted by the number of workdays absent in excess of thirty (30) regular working days; however, only one (1) thirty (30) day period shall be credited in adjusting the anniversary date during such an extended Leave of Absence.",
            "block_bbox": [
