        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. In the event an employee is laid off for lack of work after completing the Probationary Period, and thereafter recalled within sixty (60) calendar months from the date of layoff, the employee's anniversary date shall be adjusted the number of regular working days not worked due to layoff",
